<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mast back in profit.</title>
<headline>Mast back in profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>13 months to Aug 31 vs 12 months to July 1995</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.93	  vs 9.51 loss</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.41	  vs 2.07 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.83	  vs 2.35 loss</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.42	  vs 0.29 credit</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.15	  vs 0.97</p>
<p>    Turnover		  45.12	 vs 32.52</p>
<p>Full name: Mast Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Advanced Technical Systems Ltd acquired a controlling interest in Mast earlier thisyear.</p>
<p>The company said group prospects were very positive. Consideration will be given to a dividend in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
